    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Dystofarm&quot; - Discover a Unique Post-Apocalyptic World</strong><br><br><strong>Control a Singular Farmer:</strong> Master the unique skills of a farmer in a devastated world. Extract souls from defeated mutated creatures to customize your inventory with unique weapons, shields, and hats.<br><br><strong>Explore an Endless World:</strong> Start from an idyllic farm and venture into an ever-changing, vast laboratory. Challenges and surprises await at every turn.<br><br><strong>Mutated Creatures and Challenges:</strong> Confront deadly creatures and overcome obstacles in your quest to uncover the origin of mutations. Only the brave will survive in this transformed world.<br><br><strong>A Mystery to Solve:</strong> Every step brings you closer to the enigma behind the devastation. Uncover the truth hidden in the shadows.<br><br><strong>Unique Customization:</strong> Acquire souls from mutated creatures to personalize your farmer. Forge your destiny in a world full of surprises.",
